<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Dec 4.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Dec 4.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>TBN 50-55,000 tonnes barley NoPac/Saudi Arabia 12-17/12 $21.00 or $21.50 7,000/3,000 Glencore.</p>
<p>Patmos 65,000 dwcc 3.088 million cu ft 10-19/12 Mississippi/A-H range incl Seaforth 10 days $825,000 lump sum Cargill.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
